  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to improve the cost-efficiency of the Municipality by improving the productivity and hence the  services to the public. Expected results; design of an institutional development plan, personnel trained, 3 routines simplified, 3 persons trained to run work simplification programs .</narrative>
